{"version":1,"content":"<p>《2026香港小姐競選》（6）佳麗盧蔚晴（Jasmine Lo）自參選以來憑藉出眾外形與高調作風，一直是傳媒及網民關注的風頭躉。</p><p>雖然最終未能打入三甲飲恨落選，但卸下選美包袱後的她生活依然多姿多采，更頻繁在社交平台大派福利，展現真我個性。</p><p>&amp;l</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T05:19:30.845703+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T04:37:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T05:12:51.593771+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T05:12:51.593771+00:00","content_hash":"65b75f9aa7dfe0109786c9f7b40a091826d9f76656bbc9857a89b758ef7803e0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}